        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. On days preceding paid holidays, on county-wide election days, or preceding non-paid holidays (winter, spring, etc.), the teachers' duty day shall end at the close of the students' day. If the day preceding the paid holiday, county-wide election day, non-paid holiday (winter, spring, etc.) is a non-student contact day, the teachers' duty day shall be six (6) hours and thirty (30) minutes of continuous time, including a duty free lunch. On county-wide election days, teachers whose duty day usually begins forty-five (45) minutes or more before the student day who wish to vote before the duty day begins, may opt for reporting to work fifteen (15) minutes before the student day.",
